 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Where you're going",
     "texto": [
      "To say where you are going, **в** or **на** with the accusative is used: **в библиотеку** (to the library), **в бассейн** (to the pool), **на стадион** (to the stadium), **на почту** (to the post office).",
      "Feminine nouns in **-а** change to **-у**: **библиотека** → **библиотеку**, **почта** → **почту**. In these inanimate destinations, the masculine and neuter nouns keep their form: **в бассейн**, **на стадион**, **на занятие**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With «на» or «в»",
     "texto": [
      "With **на** many service or activity places are used: **на почту**, **на стадион**, **на занятие** (to class). With **в** many buildings are used: **в библиотеку**, **в бассейн**, **в поликлинику** (to the clinic). It is a guide: the combination depends on the usual use of each place.",
      "To say where you are, the prepositional is used: **в библиотеке** (in the library), **на почте** (at the post office)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Time expression",
     "texto": [
      "**В субботу** (on Saturday) shows when you go; it does not express a destination."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The verb идти",
     "texto": [
      "**Идти** means to go on foot in one direction. The forms in this lesson are **я иду**, **ты идёшь**, **он/она идёт** and **мы идём**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
